  <p id="c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p001:m0000" ref="otw_1ui_wba_C">誕世</persName>兄車騎參軍新興太守<persName id="c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p001:m0011" ref="otw_1ui_wba_E">景世</persName>、<persName id="c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p001:m0014" ref="otw_1ui_wba_E">景世</persName>弟<persName id="c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p001:m0017" ref="otw_1ui_wba_F">寶世</persName>，詣廷尉歸罪，並徙遠州。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">世祖初，徙者並得還。</p>
